{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/WalletExtensionsGuide","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"title":"Wallet Extensions","roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/NetworkTokenProvisioningGuide","doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/ManualIntegration","doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/SecurityGuide","doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/AdditionalResources"],"title":"Guides","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In addition to in-app provisioning, you can let cardholders add their payment cards from the Apple Wallet app itself. When configured, your app’s name and icon appear in Wallet’s "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From Apps on Your iPhone"}]},{"type":"text","text":" section, giving users another path to provision their cards."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This requires two app extensions:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Extension"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Purpose","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Non-UI Extension","type":"text"}]}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Provides card data, status, and handles the provisioning flow","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"UI Extension","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Presents your custom authentication UI before provisioning"}]}]]],"header":"row"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK provides two base classes that handle the complexity of communicating with Apple Wallet. You subclass them and provide your app-specific logic."}]},{"anchor":"Prerequisites","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Prerequisites"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Before implementing wallet extensions:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Complete the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/GettingStarted","type":"reference"},{"text":" guide and have in-app provisioning working.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Ensure you have the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.developer.payment-pass-provisioning"},{"text":" entitlement. This entitlement must be added to ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"all three targets","type":"text"}]},{"text":": the main app, the Non-UI Extension, and the UI Extension.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set up a shared keychain access group so the main app and extensions can share cached data."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"anchor":"Step-1-Create-the-Non-UI-Extension-Target","text":"Step 1: Create the Non-UI Extension Target","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In Xcode, go to ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"File > New > Target","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Select the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Action Extension"}]},{"type":"text",